  "Z_tex": "Z = \\tfrac12\\sum N^{A}_{l\\tilde l}\\,N^{A}_{l'\\tilde l'}\\,b^{(l,\\epsilon,l')}\\overline{b^{(\\tilde l,\\epsilon,\\tilde l')}}",
  "character_tex": "The $\\mathcal{N}=1$ characters $\\chi^{NS}_{r,s} = q^{-c/24}\\prod_{n\\ge1}\\frac{1+q^{n-1/2}}{1-q^n}\\sum_{k}\\left(q^{a_k}-q^{b_k}\\right)$ and $\\chi^{R}_{r,s} = q^{1/16-c/24}\\prod_{n\\ge1}\\frac{1+q^{n}}{1-q^n}\\sum_{k}\\left(q^{a_k}-q^{b_k}\\right)$, $a_k = \\frac{(2pp'k+p'r-ps)^2-4}{8pp'}$, $b_k = \\frac{(2pp'k+p'r+ps)^2-4}{8pp'}$, $(p,p') = (17,19)$. With $r = l+1$, $s = l'+1$: $b^{(l,0,l')}$ and $b^{(l,2,l')}$ are the parts of $\\chi^{NS}_{r,s}$ at integer and half-integer level (whichever matches the coset weight), and $b^{(l,1,l')} = \\chi^R_{r,s}$.",
  "description": "Coset $SU(2)_{15}\\times SU(2)_2/SU(2)_{17}$ with the (A,A) invariant (A on the level-15 label, A on the level-17 label). Blocks are the coset branching functions $b^{(l,\\epsilon,l')}$ with $(l,\\epsilon,l')\\sim(15-l,2-\\epsilon,17-l')$.",
